  "question": {
    "text": "When a gas is bubbled through water at 298 K, a very dilute solution of gas is obtained. Henry's law constant for the gas is 100 kbar. If gas exerts a pressure of 1 bar, the number of moles of gas dissolved in 1 litre of water is <math> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mrow> <mn>10</mn></mrow> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math> . Find the value of <math> <mtext>x</mtext> </math> here?<br />\rReport your answer upto two decimal places.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "55.55",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Mole of fraction <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Mole&nbsp;of&nbsp;gas</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Total&nbsp;moles</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Moles of <math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mtext>H</mtext>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>O</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mfrac>   <mrow>    <mtext>1000</mtext></mrow>   <mrow>    <mtext>18</mtext></mrow>  </mfrac>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>55</mtext><mtext>.55</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mfenced>   <mrow>    <mo>&#x2234;</mo><mtext>1</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>L</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>1000</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow>  </mfenced><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>&#x00D7;</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msup>   <mrow>    <mtext>10</mtext></mrow>   <mrow>    <mo>&#x2212;</mo><mtext>5</mtext></mrow>  </msup>  </mrow></math><br /><br />Mole fraction <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>55.55</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>55.55</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />So <math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>55.55</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>55.55</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
